{"title":"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the following conditions on the positive integer (natural number) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p>1. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/031c526b47a31f681ebc10c0a675cf69e2d6fcc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a + 5 &gt; 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"92\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>2. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/0/e905d60aa8a23f66310082f0f9044e45224773c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49a \\ge 301$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>3. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/5/d652df712d5a43d2fb31e167f47e3cdc2ca447bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a \\le 999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>4. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/7/c87f82b94c3e0e9b488351fb94f740ae866689dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101a + 53 \\ge 2332$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>5. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/6/d4608489a1cbadf9657c6b7c4ff52858271a0c65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15a-7 \\ge 144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"110\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>If only three of these conditions are true, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can solve each of these conditions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and also truncate the right-hand side of the inequality since we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer.\n</p><p>1. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/4/624dbd2cc00bb7b1b206912fcf6c4cecd69fb5ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a+5&gt;40 \\implies 3a&gt;35 \\implies a&gt;\\frac{35}3 \\implies \\underline{a&gt;11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"410\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>2. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/9197d633d2af500670b27846c89fdbf63fa2b05a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49a\\ge301 \\implies a\\ge\\frac{43}7 \\implies \\underline{a&gt;6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"277\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>3. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/2/072a01ec6355111a249bdb6a2c8c8dc9fc95b619.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a\\le999 \\implies a\\le\\frac{999}{20} \\implies \\underline{a&lt;50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"296\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>4. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/d/8bdec1b20e20335a6adaebf46d63f18d6337127f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101a+53\\ge2332 \\implies 101a\\ge2279 \\implies a\\ge\\frac{2279}{101} \\implies \\underline{a&gt;22}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"510\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>5. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/f/56f56a4f7dd150a4702f0f52c2d3c1963cb633ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15a-7\\ge144 \\implies 15a\\ge151 \\implies a\\ge\\frac{151}{15} \\implies \\underline{a&gt;10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"456\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Exactly two of these statements are false. \n</p><p>Note that statement 4 implies statement 1, which implies statement 5, which implies statement 2.\nThis means that 2 and 5 must both be true, or else 1, 4, and 5 are all false, which is in opposition to the fact that only two are false.\n</p><p>Note further that if 3 is false, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/e/aae1505df7e7920d9cec7662034a8620488ffcef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\ge50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" />, which implies that all four of the other statements are true. This also disagrees with the stipulation that exactly three statements are true, and two are false. Therefore statement 3 is true.\n</p><p>This leaves 1 and 4 to be the only statements that are allowed to be false. If 1 and 4 are false, and the rest are true, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd5a017d3736639485d3273aa8a895aa1275d42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\le11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> (the inverse of statement 1) and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ec0baf166cdf5e317db20a0ae7c05a04782e178.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" /> (statement 5). The only natural number that satisfies this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/6/8e68cd88dfd18d0d57d5eda5f999afbe6e59b53c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{a=11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC\" title=\"2005 PMWC\">2005 PMWC </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I4\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I4\">Problem I4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I6\">Problem I6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">I: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I2\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I3\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I4\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I8\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I9\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I10\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I11\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I12\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I13\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I14\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I15\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I15\">15</a> <br /> T: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T1\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T2\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T3\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T4\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T5\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T6\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T7\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T8\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T9\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T10\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T10\">10</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCache